Runtime logos (not in this repo)
--------------------------------

Token, ticker, chain, and domain artwork may be loaded at runtime
from logo.dev (img.logo.dev) or, if no logo.dev token is set,
from Clearbit-style domain URLs. Those images are served by the
third party and are not part of this source tree.

